@startuml
!theme plain
left to right direction
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
title Fictional Service Booking Platform — Adapted HLD Example
actor "Customer" as Customer
actor "Operator" as Operator
component "Customer Portal" as CustomerUI
component "Operations Portal" as OpsUI
component "CRM Portal" as CRMUI
package "Booking Platform" {
  component "API Gateway" as Gateway
  component "User Service" as Users
  component "Order Service" as Orders
  component "Session Service" as Sessions
  component "Authorization Service" as Auth
  component "Notification Service" as Notify
  queue "Message Broker" as Broker
  database "Domain Stores" as DB
}
cloud "External Payment Provider" as Payments
cloud "Email Provider" as Email
cloud "Conference Provider" as Conference
Customer --> CustomerUI : view / book
Operator --> OpsUI : manage sessions
CustomerUI --> Gateway : HTTPS
OpsUI --> Gateway : HTTPS
CRMUI --> Gateway : HTTPS
Gateway --> Auth : verify access
Gateway --> Users : profile
Gateway --> Orders : create order
Gateway --> Sessions : reserve session
Orders --> Payments : payment intent
Orders --> Broker : notification event
Broker --> Notify : email task
Notify --> Email : send email
Sessions --> Conference : session link
Orders --> DB : order records
Sessions --> DB : reservation records
note bottom of DB
Logical view only. All component names are fictional.
State, money and notifications have different owners.
end note
@enduml